# case-management-flow

## Case Type Workflows (Importance: 90)

Legal case management implements specialized workflows based on case type:

- Custody Reunification
  - Required document verification stages
  - Court hearing milestone tracking 
  - Visitation scheduling requirements
  - Service completion validation

- Record Expungement
  - Criminal record verification steps
  - Required documentation checklist
  - Court filing milestone tracking
  - Background check validation points

## Document Verification States (Importance: 85)

Document workflow states with required validation:

- Pending Review
- Under Verification 
- Requires Correction
- Verified
- Rejected

Each state transition requires specific validation rules based on document type and case requirements.

## Case Milestone Tracking (Importance: 80)

Case progress tracking through defined milestones:

- Initial Consultation
- Document Collection
- Court Filing
- Hearing Scheduled
- Final Resolution

Milestones link to required documentation and validation checkpoints based on case type.

